NO cap and NO global queue in this path. The parallel branch is an unbounded `Promise.all` over every toolCall in the message (`agent-loop.js:372`); grep for `mutex|semaphore|concurrency|p-limit|withLock` across `pkg/dist/core/extensions/runner.js`, `pkg/dist/core/agent-session.js` returns nothing. The only serialization primitives found are:
